{"speciesId":801,"names":{"fr":"Magearna","es":"Magearna","en":"Magearna","ja":"マギアナ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Ce Pokémon a été créé de toutes pièces il y a 500 ans. Il comprend ce qu’on lui dit, mais il n’est pas doué de parole."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Pokémon artificial creado hace más de 500 años. Es capaz de entender el lenguaje humano, pero carece de la facultad del habla."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"This artificial Pokémon, constructed more than 500 years ago, can understand human speech but cannot itself speak."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"５００年以上前に 造られた 人造ポケモン。 人の 言葉を 理解するが しゃべれない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Son corps mécanique n’est qu’une enveloppe. Sa véritable nature est une âme artificielle nommée Animacœur."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"El mecanismo que conforma su cuerpo es tan solo un recipiente. Su verdadera esencia es un alma artificial llamada Coránima."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Its mechanized body is merely a vessel. Its true self is its Soul-Heart, an artificial soul."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"機械仕掛けの 身体は ただの 器。 ソウルハートと 呼ばれる 人造の 魂が 本体。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il accède à la conscience des individus en se synchronisant avec eux. Cette faculté l’aide à prendre soin d’eux."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Sincroniza su consciencia con la de los demás para comprender sus sentimientos. Utiliza esta capacidad para cuidar de las personas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It synchronizes its consciousness with others to understand their feelings. This faculty makes it useful for taking care of people."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"意識を 同調させて 相手の 気持ちを 理解。 人の お世話を するのに 便利な 能力。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il a été créé par un scientifique il y a environ 500 ans de cela. Sa véritable essence est un organe nommé Animacœur."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Pokémon artificial creado por científicos hace unos 500 años. Su verdadera esencia es una pieza llamada Coránima."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Built roughly 500 years ago by a scientist, the part called the Soul-Heart is the actual life-form."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"およそ ５００年前 科学者に よって 作られた。 ソウルハートと 呼ばれる パーツが 本体なのだ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":801,"moves":[{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"sonic-boom","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"psybeam","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",30],[25,"level-up",30],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"aurora-beam","learns":[[17,"level-up",17],[18,"level-up",17],[20,"level-up",36],[25,"level-up",36]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"solar-beam","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunderbolt","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-wave","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"psychic","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"agility","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"confuse-ray","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"defense-curl","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",6],[25,"level-up",6]]},{"name":"light-screen","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"reflect","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"self-destruct","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"swift","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name"